;redcode-94x verbose
;name Tri Warrior 3 (5 lines)
;author Simon Duff
;assert 1

for 0
   This is based on Ring Thing that I wrote a while back. Just a continuous
   launching imp spiral.
rof

      ORG	start

      spl     imp-266 
start spl     -1        
      spl     imp+267    
imp   mov.i   #267,    *0
